## else if
What if you have more than two options? Chain conditions with `else if`:

```qc
int x = 15;
if (x > 20) {
    println("High");
} else if (x > 10) {
    println("Medium");
} else {
    println("Low");
}
// prints: Medium
```

Conditions are checked top to bottom. The first one that's true runs, the rest are skipped. `else` at the end catches everything else.

You can chain as many `else if` blocks as you want.


